  6 | rrd_other | SELECT sift.projection_create('rrd_x', 'rrd.ins', ARRAY['member'])                               | ERROR: permission denied for table ins
  7 | rrd_other | SELECT * FROM sift.scope_follow_pairs('rrd.pairs', 'rrd.pairs_v', 'rrd.ins', 'member', 'member') | ERROR: must be owner of table ins
